{"id":475,"root":"لوم","bw":"lwm","tr":"l-w-m","found":true,"html":"<div class=\"lane-entry\">See Supplement </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\">  <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لَامَ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> </span>, inf. n. <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لَومٌ</span>, <em>He blamed, censured,</em> or <em>reprehended,</em> syn. <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عَذَلَ</span>, (S, M, Msb, K,) a person, (S, Msb,) <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عَلَى كَذَا</span> [for such a thing]. (S.) </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\">  <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَلَامَ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> </span> <em>He did a thing for which he should be blamed.</em> (S in art. <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جنف</span>, and L and TA in art. <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ريب</span>.) </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\">  <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تَلَوَّمَ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> </span> <em>i. q.</em> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تَكَلَّفَ اللَّومَ</span>. (Ham, p. 356.) </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\"> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لَايءِمَةٌ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> </span> <em>A thing for which the doer is blamed.</em> (TA.) </div>","pages":null,"shownPages":null,"chars":984,"entries":5,"shownEntries":5,"truncated":false,"match":"direct","key":"lwm"}